{"text":"Then you take the charcoal, and under everything else, you write one more line. GONE EAST. DAY 88. In case you ever have to come back. In case someone else ever finds it. \"Thank you,\" you say. Out loud. To a hole in the ground. It doesn't feel stupid. You crawl out, and from the outside, for the first time, you slide the stone slab across the door. So it's still here if you ever need it.","mood":"sad","settings":{"stability":0.4,"style":0.7,"speed":1.02},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","t","a","k","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","h","a","r","c","o","a","l",","," ","a","n","d"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","e","v","e","r","y","t","h","i","n","g"," ","e","l","s","e",","," ","y","o","u"," ","w","r","i","t","e"," ","o","n","e"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","l","i","n","e","."," ","G","O","N","E"," ","E","A","S","T","."," ","D","A","Y"," ","8","8","."," ","I","n"," ","c","a","s","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","e","v","e","r"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","t","o"," ","c","o","m","e"," ","b","a","c","k","."," ","I","n"," ","c","a","s","e"," ","s","o","m","e","o","n","e"," ","e","l","s","e"," ","e","v","e","r"," ","f","i","n","d","s"," ","i","t","."," ","\"","T","h","a","n","k"," ","y","o","u",",","\""," ","y","o","u"," ","s","a","y","."," ","O","u","t"," ","l","o","u","d","."," ","T","o"," ","a"," ","h","o","l","e"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","g","r","o","u","n","d","."," ","I","t"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","f","e","e","l"," ","s","t","u","p","i","d","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","c","r","a","w","l"," ","o","u","t",","," ","a","n","d"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","o","u","t","s","i","d","e",","," ","f","o","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","t","i","m","e",","," ","y","o","u"," ","s","l","i","d","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","t","o","n","e"," ","s","l","a","b"," ","a","c","r","o","s","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","o","o","r","."," ","S","o"," ","i","t","'","s"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","h","e","r","e"," ","i","f"," ","y","o","